# App version

`android/app/build.gradle.kts` `versionName` is **x.y.z**. Home shows `BuildConfig.VERSION_NAME` in the top bar and at the bottom of the screen.

On every change that the user will install as an APK (code, UI, or user-facing help):

1. Bump **patch** (`z` in `x.y.z`) by 1, unless the user asked for a minor/major bump.
2. Bump `versionCode` by 1 (must always increase).
3. When you finish coding, tell the user the new version (e.g. **1.0.1**).

Do not leave two APKs with the same `versionName`.
